<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Torchmark cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Torchmark cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut its rating of Torchmark Corp to neutral from outperform on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/8 to 65 in early trading.</p>
